 "_doc": "Mauville Game Corner (Sapphire 22x11, zone 237). Black 2 has no Game Corner: the Musical Theater's red carpet (in24_carpet, set 305) as the floor and the Battle Test room's teal wall (in25kabe_01, set 306) for Sapphire's sky wall. Slot machines (2-3 and 7-8, rows 6-9) = Black 2's terminal pc01, facing the seats (west column faces west, east column east, as the signs' facing); the seats (1, 4, 6, 9 at rows 6-9, walkable) = Pokéstar Studios' blue seat picture in76_sof01 on the floor; roulette tables (14-15, 18-19 at rows 6-8) = table01; the prize counter (9-15, 2-3) = white counters; vending machines (0-1, 2) = in_vender01; trash cans (2,2)/(21,4) = dust01; plants (5-7, 2). The back wall is one row further south over (18-21) as in Sapphire, with the yellow sofas (18-21, 3) = seat pictures (in01_isu, set 282).",
